 "summary": "nomacs ('Image Lounge') is a free, open-source image viewer with RAW and PSD support, metadata panels, image adjustments and batch processing. A distinctive feature is synchronising several instances to compare images side by side. Current macOS builds exist for Apple silicon and Intel, though they are not notarized.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Batch processing and basic image editing",
  "Synchronise several windows to compare images",
  "Metadata panels, histogram and star ratings",
  "Plugins (paint, composite, transforms)",
  "Runs on Windows, Linux, FreeBSD and Haiku"
 ],
